@startuml Elmo_CANopen_Architecture
!theme plain
title Elmo CANopen 伺服电机驱动器架构图

' 定义颜色和样式
skinparam component {
    BackgroundColor<<application>> #e6f3ff
    BorderColor<<application>> #0066cc
    BackgroundColor<<control>> #fff2e6
    BorderColor<<control>> #ff6600
    BackgroundColor<<communication>> #f0fff0
    BorderColor<<communication>> #009900
    BackgroundColor<<hardware>> #ffe6e6
    BorderColor<<hardware>> #cc0000
    BackgroundColor<<device>> #f5f5f5
    BorderColor<<device>> #333333
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #f9f9f9
    BorderColor #999999
}

' 定义包和组件
package "应用层 (Application Layer)" as AppLayer {
    component [main.c] <<application>> as MainApp
    note right of MainApp
        • 程序入口点
        • 测试位置/力控制
        • 系统初始化
        • test() / test_position() / test_force()
    end note
}

package "控制层 (Control Layer)" as ControlLayer {
    component [elmo.h / elmo.c] <<control>> as ElmoControl
    note right of ElmoControl
        • 电机控制接口
        • setPosition() / getPosition()
        • setForce() / getForce()
        • startMotor() / stopMotor()
        • setUnitMode() / setSpeed()
        • beginMotion() / stop()
    end note
}

package "通信层 (Communication Layer)" as CommLayer {
    component [can.h / can.c] <<communication>> as CANComm
    note right of CANComm
        • CAN总线通信
        • TCanConstruct() / TCanOpen()
        • sendPDO2() / receivePDO2()
        • createFrame() / sendFrame()
        • 数据格式转换
        • setDataInt() / setDataFloat()
    end note
}

package "硬件抽象层 (Hardware Layer)" as HardwareLayer {
    component [Linux CAN Socket] <<hardware>> as LinuxCAN
    note right of LinuxCAN
        • SocketCAN 接口
        • can0 网络接口
        • CANopen 协议支持
        • 内核级CAN驱动
    end note
}

package "设备层 (Device Layer)" as DeviceLayer {
    component [Elmo 伺服驱动器] <<device>> as ElmoDevice
    note right of ElmoDevice
        • CANopen 节点 ID: 127
        • 位置/力矩控制模式
        • 实时反馈
        • 硬件安全保护
    end note
}

' 定义关系和数据流
MainApp --> ElmoControl : 调用控制接口
MainApp --> CANComm : 直接CAN通信
ElmoControl --> CANComm : 使用CAN通信
CANComm --> LinuxCAN : 系统调用
LinuxCAN --> ElmoDevice : CAN总线协议

' 依赖关系 (虚线)
ElmoControl ..> CANComm : 依赖

' 数据流注释
note as DataFlow
    **数据流向:**
    main → elmo → can → Linux Socket → 硬件
    
    **通信协议:**
    • CANopen PDO2 通信
    • ASCII 命令格式
    • 4-8字节数据长度
    • COB-ID: 0x301-0x37f (发送)
    • COB-ID: 0x281-0x2ff (接收)
end note

' 配置信息
note as ConfigInfo
    **系统配置:**
    • CAN接口: can0
    • CANopen节点ID: 127
    • 控制模式: 位置模式(5) / 力矩模式(1)
    • 通信速率: 标准CAN (125kbps-1Mbps)
end note

@enduml